# Generated PDF security reports are private.
#
# A report embeds the scanned source code, so it must only ever be
# reached through the token endpoint (`/api/reports/download?token=...`),
# which checks the expiry before it streams anything.
#
# This folder therefore denies every direct HTTP request. The API itself
# reads the files through the filesystem, which this rule does not
# affect.
Require all denied
